{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.koito.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "面试室的椅子上坐得笔直",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.koito.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.koito.first",
    "idolId": "koito",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——呃……福丸小糸小姐。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "ぴゃ……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶、啊、那个……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不用那么紧张也没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "像平时那样回答就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那么，先说说你想当偶像的契机…… 愿意告诉我你为什么报名 283 制作吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "福丸小姐？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………大、大家……一起…………",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，这样。你的幼驯染也在 283 制作呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "幼驯染之间，关系真好啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "你、你明白吗……？就是这样……！我们非常要好……！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈，嗯，我明白。大家能一起活动的话，会是不错的组合。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿……就是这样……！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那么，在这之中，你自己想成为什么样的偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "撇开幼驯染，你自己想做的事、想成为的偶像，有吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………想成为的……偶像……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……有点难吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "啊……那个…………",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我、我……那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——那么，福丸小糸小姐。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "ぴゃい……！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在偶像活动里，你想成为什么样的偶像，能想一想吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这就是你作为 283 制作旗下偶像的，第一个课题。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………诶！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今后请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………！好！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，还有最后一件。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你还是高一，和学业兼顾没问题吧？当然，也需要父母的同意。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "…………没、没问题……！"
      }
    }
  },
